ഒന്നാം ഘട്ടത്തിലെ പരിശോധന.

Hamlet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Cordelia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Desdemona, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Portia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Viola, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Miranda, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ariel, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Caliban, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Caliban and Prospero]
Caliban: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Ariel]
Caliban: You are as good as the difference between a big big big big big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ariel]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
Prospero: Are you better than nothing?
Ariel:
 If not, let us proceed to scene III.
Prospero: You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
Ariel:
 You are as good as the product of yourself and a big hero.
 Let us return to scene II.

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Prospero]
Caliban: You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Caliban and Hamlet]
Caliban: You are as good as the sum of a big big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Juliet]
Caliban: You are as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Romeo]
Caliban: You are as good as the sum of a big big big big big hero and the sum of a big big big hero and the sum of a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Othello]
Caliban: You are as good as the sum of a big big big big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and the sum of a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Macbeth]
Caliban: You are as good as the sum of a big big big big big big hero and the sum of a big big big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Caliban and Viola]
Caliban: You are a big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Miranda]
Caliban: You are nothing.
[Exeunt]

Act II: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Viola and Caliban]
Viola: Am I better than the sum of the sum of a big big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a big hero?
Caliban: If so, let us proceed to act IV.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Caliban and Lady Macbeth]
Caliban:
 You are as good as the sum of the product of Hamlet and Hamlet and the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Viola.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Prospero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Caliban and Ophelia]
Caliban:
 You are as good as the sum of the product of Juliet and Juliet and the product of the sum of a big big hero and a hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Prospero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Caliban and Cordelia]
Caliban:
 You are as good as the sum of the product of Romeo and Romeo and the product of the sum of the sum of a big big hero and a big hero and a hero and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Juliet.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Prospero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Caliban and Desdemona]
Caliban:
 You are as good as the sum of the product of Othello and Othello and the product of the sum of the sum of a big big big hero and a big hero and a hero and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Romeo.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Prospero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene VI: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Caliban and Portia]
Caliban:
 You are as good as the sum of the product of Macbeth and Macbeth and the product of the sum of the sum of a big big big hero and a big big hero and a hero and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Othello.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Prospero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Act III: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Lady Macbeth and Hamlet]
Lady Macbeth: You are as good as Lady Macbeth.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Ophelia and Juliet]
Ophelia: You are as good as Ophelia.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Cordelia and Romeo]
Cordelia: You are as good as Cordelia.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Desdemona and Othello]
Desdemona: You are as good as Desdemona.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Portia and Macbeth]
Portia: You are as good as Portia.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Caliban and Miranda]
Caliban: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Viola and Caliban]
Viola: Am I as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a big hero?
Caliban: If so, let us proceed to act IV.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Viola]
Caliban: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero. Let us return to act II.
[Exeunt]

Act IV: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Miranda]
Caliban: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Caliban and Viola]
Caliban: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
